 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Samuel judged Israel all the days of his life",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Year after year he traveled the circuit wide",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bethel, Gilgal, and Mizpah were the places he knew",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Judging the people in every place he drew",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He returned to Ramah where his home was found",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There he judged Israel on the sacred ground",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he built an altar to the LORD there",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keeping the promise with unceasing care",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the high places down to the valley floor",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His voice raised the judgment to heaven's door",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In Bethel he stood and in Gilgal he sat",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Giving the people the answer they sought",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He returned to Ramah where his home was found",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There he judged Israel on the sacred ground",
