   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he built an altar to the LORD there",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keeping the promise with unceasing care",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mizpah saw his face with the people nearby",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He judged Israel with justice and supply",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then back to Ramah his journey was done",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
